meta {
  name: Create an organization
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{bffUrl}}/accounts
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "handle": "acme",
    "display_name": "ACME Ltda",
    "legal_id": "12.345.678/0001-90"
  }
}

docs {
  Any user creates their own organization — which is why no role is required. What
  is required is an ACTIVE account: the creation happens from a context (SP-0), and
  whoever creates it is born its owner.

  The personal account, that one nobody creates: it is born together with the user
  on the first sign-in (ADR-0002).
}
